
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CUSTPURG.

ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.

    SELECT CUST-MASTER
        ASSIGN TO "CUST-MASTER"
        ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
        ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
        RECORD KEY IS CUST-MASTER-KEY
        FILE STATUS IS WS-MASTER-STATUS.

DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.

FD CUST-MASTER.
01 CUST-MASTER-RECORD.
   05 CUST-MASTER-KEY PIC X(12).
   05 CUST-NAME       PIC X(25).
   05 CUST-STATUS     PIC X(13).

WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

01 WS-MASTER-STATUS      PIC XX.

01 WS-EOF                PIC X VALUE 'N'.

01 WS-DELETE-COUNT       PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-NOTFOUND-COUNT     PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-ERROR-COUNT        PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-TOTAL-COUNT        PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.
01 WS-SKIP-COUNT         PIC 9(5) VALUE ZERO.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

MAIN-PROCESS.

    OPEN I-O CUST-MASTER

    IF WS-MASTER-STATUS NOT = '00'
        DISPLAY 'ERROR OPENING CUSTOMER MASTER'
        DISPLAY 'FILE STATUS: ' WS-MASTER-STATUS
        STOP RUN
    END-IF

    DISPLAY 'CUSTOMER MASTER OPEN SUCCESSFUL'

    PERFORM READ-AND-PURGE

    CLOSE CUST-MASTER

    DISPLAY ' '
    DISPLAY '========================================'
    DISPLAY '       PURGE BATCH SUMMARY'
    DISPLAY '========================================'

    DISPLAY 'TOTAL RECORDS READ  : '
            WS-TOTAL-COUNT

    DISPLAY 'SUCCESSFUL DELETIONS: '
            WS-DELETE-COUNT

    DISPLAY 'CUSTOMERS NOT FOUND : '
            WS-NOTFOUND-COUNT

    DISPLAY 'SKIPPED RECORDS     : '
            WS-SKIP-COUNT

    DISPLAY 'OTHER ERRORS        : '
            WS-ERROR-COUNT

    DISPLAY '========================================'
    DISPLAY 'PURGE BATCH COMPLETED'
    DISPLAY '========================================'

    STOP RUN.


READ-AND-PURGE.

    MOVE LOW-VALUES TO CUST-MASTER-KEY

    START CUST-MASTER
        KEY IS GREATER THAN OR EQUAL TO CUST-MASTER-KEY
        INVALID KEY
            MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
    END-START

    PERFORM UNTIL WS-EOF = 'Y'

        READ CUST-MASTER NEXT RECORD

            AT END
                MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF

            NOT AT END
                PERFORM PROCESS-CUSTOMER

        END-READ

        IF WS-MASTER-STATUS NOT = '00'
           AND WS-MASTER-STATUS NOT = '10'
            DISPLAY 'READ ERROR: ' WS-MASTER-STATUS
            ADD 1 TO WS-ERROR-COUNT
            MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF
        END-IF

    END-PERFORM.


PROCESS-CUSTOMER.

    ADD 1 TO WS-TOTAL-COUNT

    DISPLAY '----------------------------------------'
    DISPLAY 'CUSTOMER ID   : ' CUST-MASTER-KEY
    DISPLAY 'CUSTOMER NAME : ' CUST-NAME
    DISPLAY 'CUSTOMER STATUS: ' CUST-STATUS

    IF CUST-STATUS = 'CLOSED'

        DELETE CUST-MASTER RECORD
            INVALID KEY
                CONTINUE
        END-DELETE

        EVALUATE WS-MASTER-STATUS

            WHEN '00'

                DISPLAY 'DELETE RESULT : SUCCESS'
                ADD 1 TO WS-DELETE-COUNT

            WHEN '23'

                DISPLAY 'DELETE RESULT : NOT FOUND'
                ADD 1 TO WS-NOTFOUND-COUNT

            WHEN OTHER

                DISPLAY 'DELETE RESULT : ERROR'
                DISPLAY 'FILE STATUS  : '
                        WS-MASTER-STATUS

                ADD 1 TO WS-ERROR-COUNT

        END-EVALUATE

    ELSE

        DISPLAY 'DELETE RESULT : SKIPPED - NOT CLOSED'
        ADD 1 TO WS-SKIP-COUNT

    END-IF.
